rectangle "==Mailprovider\n<size:9>[Software System]</size>\n\nExterner E-Mail-Dienst. Empfängt Callbacks über den Message Broker." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxFeHRlcm5hbA==>> as Mailprovider
